  1044	We further analyzed the causes behind the performance decline for both variants. For RoamSim, we found it less effective in finding the correct UI event sequence when there were multiple
  1045	UI events similar to the same step. Roam-Sim searched for the UI events purely based on their
  1046	similarity with the steps. Therefore, if there were multiple UI events similar to the same step,
  1047	Roam-Sim considered all of them possible to reproduce the step. As a result, the correct event
  1048	sequence was ranked lower. Ultimately, Roam-Sim either failed to find the correct events because
  1049	of the low ranking or did not have enough time to execute them, causing a failure of reproduction.
  1050	For Roam-Dist, without considering the similarity with the reproduction steps, its reproduction
  1051	process was reduced to an exhaustive search through all event paths in the app. In most cases, such
  1052	an exploration was extremely time-consuming and unable to reproduce the bug within the time
  1053	limit.
